/*---
esid: sec-asyncdisposablestack.prototype.adopt
description: Adds a disposable resource to the stack
info: |
  AsyncDisposableStack.prototype.adopt ( value, onDisposeAsync )

  1. Let asyncDisposableStack be the this value.
